      "imagePath": "images/02.jpg",
      "text": "Lalu the owl was a friendly fellow. All the birds in the jungle were his friends."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "imagePath": "images/03.jpg",
      "text": "But Lalu's best friend in the jungle was Sweety, the peacock."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "imagePath": "images/04.jpg",
      "text": "One day Lalu organised a party and called all his friends."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "imagePath": "images/05.jpg",
      "text": "In the party, all the birds danced and gifted Lalu with a crown of feathers."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "imagePath": "images/06.jpg",
      "text": "Lalu slept happily that night."
    }
  ]
